usage: etl.py [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--input INPUT_PATH]
              [--output-root OUTPUT_ROOT] [--limit LIMIT] [--master MASTER]

PaySim batch ETL: raw CSV -> validated Parquet and replay handoff. Run from
the project root: python -m src.processing.etl --limit 10000 Or run directly:
python ./src/processing/etl.py --limit 10000 Input is one local UTF-8 CSV with
one record per physical line. Local Docker storage is supported here; HDFS and
multiline CSV require separate ingestion.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --input INPUT_PATH    One local CSV file, using the container path
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
                        Parent directory for versioned ETL outputs
  --limit LIMIT         Process the first N physical data lines, including
                        invalid rows
  --master MASTER       Override local[2] from config
